  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Putting Children First - CAFOD Internal Grant</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Project being funded by Caritas Australia is a follow up to the OVC Putting Children First IPDF funded which came to an end in June 2013. The project is contributing to the programme being implemented by select partners namely, Mavambo Trust, Mashambanzou Care Trust and St Albert&apos;s Mission Hospital based in Harare and Chinhoyi Diocese.
The Goal of this programme is: to improve children&#x2019;s access to essential protection services in Zimbabwe
The objectives are:
1. To establish a community-level volunteer system to provide immediate support and services to children
2. To improve children&#x2019;s access to existing education, health and social services 
3. To facilitate children&#x2019;s access to birth registration/legal identity documents 
The CAFOD grant will be used to support the baseline survey to be conducted for the three partners as well as supporting the partners&apos; coordination meetings.</narrative>
  </description>
